st correctly?</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3573" data-end=3D"3677">
<p data-start=3D"3575" data-end=3D"3677">If you use an API (Open-Meteo, etc=
.), are you asking for the same <strong data-start=3D"3641" data-end=3D"365=
8">forecast time</strong> that Zeus expects?</p>
</li>
</ul>
