ce</h3>
<p data-start=3D"686" data-end=3D"771">They explicitly say:<br data-start=
=3D"706" data-end=3D"709">
<strong data-start=3D"709" data-end=3D"771">=E2=80=9CGPU is not required fo=
r inference while running a miner.=E2=80=9D</strong></p>
