<p data-start=3D"6106" data-end=3D"6222">Because your logs show small grids=
 like <code data-start=3D"6146" data-end=3D"6155">(11, 9)</code>, <code dat=
a-start=3D"6157" data-end=3D"6166">(7, 13)</code>, <code data-start=3D"6168=
" data-end=3D"6178">(13, 12)</code>, a CNN over those grids is very reasona=
ble.</p>
