<ol start=3D"2" data-start=3D"13018" data-end=3D"13339">
<li data-start=3D"13018" data-end=3D"13339">
<p data-start=3D"13021" data-end=3D"13058">For each Zeus request in <code d=
ata-start=3D"13046" data-end=3D"13057">forward()</code>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"13063" data-end=3D"13339">
<li data-start=3D"13063" data-end=3D"13156">
<p data-start=3D"13065" data-end=3D"13156">Build an input tensor <code data=
-start=3D"13087" data-end=3D"13110">(context_hours, H, W)</code> based on E=
RA5 history or some context source.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"13160" data-end=3D"13192">
<p data-start=3D"13162" data-end=3D"13192">Normalize: <code data-start=3D"1=
3173" data-end=3D"13191">(x - mean) / std</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"13196" data-end=3D"13240">
<p data-start=3D"13198" data-end=3D"13240">Run <code data-start=3D"13202" d=
ata-end=3D"13239">model(x_batch)[0][:requested_hours]</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"13244" data-end=3D"13280">
<p data-start=3D"13246" data-end=3D"13280">De-normalize: <code data-start=
=3D"13260" data-end=3D"13279">pred * std + mean</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"13284" data-end=3D"13339">
<p data-start=3D"13286" data-end=3D"13339">Return shape <code data-start=3D=
"13299" data-end=3D"13324">(requested_hours, H, W)</code> in ERA5 units.</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"13341" data-end=3D"13455">We can wire that exactly once yo=
u decide <strong data-start=3D"13382" data-end=3D"13415">what context you w=
ant to feed</strong> (ERA5 past, Open-Meteo baseline, etc.).</p>
<hr data-start=3D"13457" data-end=3D"13460">
<p data-start=3D"13462" data-end=3D"13492">If you want, next step we can:</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"13494" data-end=3D"13710">
<li data-start=3D"13494" data-end=3D"13550">
<p data-start=3D"13496" data-end=3D"13550">Pick <strong data-start=3D"13501=
" data-end=3D"13517">one variable</strong> (like <code data-start=3D"13524"=
 data-end=3D"13549">2m_dewpoint_temperature</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"13551" data-end=3D"13630">
<p data-start=3D"13553" data-end=3D"13630">Decide how to get context in the=
 miner (ERA5 loader vs Open-Meteo correction)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"13631" data-end=3D"13710">
<p data-start=3D"13633" data-end=3D"13710">I=E2=80=99ll then rewrite your <=
code data-start=3D"13656" data-end=3D"13674">neurons/miner.py</code> to act=
ually use this trained model.</p>
</li>
</ul>
