<h1 data-start=3D"1301" data-end=3D"1330">=F0=9F=92=AC <strong data-start=
=3D"1306" data-end=3D"1330">So the exact answer:</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start=3D"1332" data-end=3D"1391">=F0=9F=91=89 You should download =
ERA5 <strong data-start=3D"1364" data-end=3D"1389">right before training</s=
trong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1392" data-end=3D"1400">because:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1402" data-end=3D"1533">
<li data-start=3D"1402" data-end=3D"1424">
<p data-start=3D"1404" data-end=3D"1424">ERA5 updates daily</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1425" data-end=3D"1467">
<p data-start=3D"1427" data-end=3D"1467">But it=E2=80=99s fine to train on =
older months</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1468" data-end=3D"1533">
<p data-start=3D"1470" data-end=3D"1533">Training requires large dataset =
=E2=86=92 download once before training</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1535" data-end=3D"1638">Once you download it and train the=
 model, you do <strong data-start=3D"1584" data-end=3D"1591">not</strong> n=
eed to keep downloading ERA5 unless you want:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1640" data-end=3D"1700">
<li data-start=3D"1640" data-end=3D"1655">
<p data-start=3D"1642" data-end=3D"1655">more months</p>
