<p data-start=3D"2545" data-end=3D"2555">This will:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2557" data-end=3D"2679">
<li data-start=3D"2557" data-end=3D"2604">
<p data-start=3D"2559" data-end=3D"2604">Shuffle over <em data-start=3D"257=
2" data-end=3D"2577">all</em> time steps from 2020=E2=80=93now</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2605" data-end=3D"2638">
<p data-start=3D"2607" data-end=3D"2638">Sample random spatial patches</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2639" data-end=3D"2679">
<p data-start=3D"2641" data-end=3D"2679">Learn a very solid dewpoint foreca=
ster</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2681" data-end=3D"2707">This can be <strong data-start=3D"=
2693" data-end=3D"2702">heavy</strong>, so:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2709" data-end=3D"2802">
<li data-start=3D"2709" data-end=3D"2750">
<p data-start=3D"2711" data-end=3D"2750">If out-of-memory =E2=86=92 lower <=
code data-start=3D"2736" data-end=3D"2748">batch-size</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2751" data-end=3D"2802">
<p data-start=3D"2753" data-end=3D"2802">If too slow =E2=86=92 start with f=
ewer years (2022=E2=80=93now)</p>
</li>
</ul>
