rns ZIP</strong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"115" data-end=3D"212">This is EXACTLY how the Copernicus C=
DS API behaves <strong data-start=3D"166" data-end=3D"211">under load or wh=
en a dataset is too large</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"214" data-end=3D"384">
<li data-start=3D"214" data-end=3D"269">
<p data-start=3D"216" data-end=3D"269"><strong data-start=3D"216" data-end=
=3D"242">Small request (1 hour)</strong> =E2=86=92 returns <em data-start=
=3D"253" data-end=3D"269">correct NetCDF</em></p>
