<li data-start=3D"270" data-end=3D"384">
<p data-start=3D"272" data-end=3D"384"><strong data-start=3D"272" data-end=
=3D"319">Large request (full month with 8 variables)</strong> =E2=86=92 ret=
urns a <strong data-start=3D"332" data-end=3D"371">ZIP file containing an E=
RROR report</strong>, NOT NetCDF.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"386" data-end=3D"464">This is a CDS limitation.<br data-st=
art=3D"411" data-end=3D"414">
We must break the request into <strong data-start=3D"445" data-end=3D"463">=
smaller chunks</strong>.</p>
