<p data-start=3D"603" data-end=3D"624">Then your model will:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"626" data-end=3D"730">
<li data-start=3D"626" data-end=3D"674">
<p data-start=3D"628" data-end=3D"674">go through all training samples once=
 (epoch 1)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"675" data-end=3D"706">
<p data-start=3D"677" data-end=3D"706">train again on them (epoch 2)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"707" data-end=3D"730">
<p data-start=3D"709" data-end=3D"730">train again (epoch 3)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"732" data-end=3D"769">Each epoch improves the weights more=
.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"771" data-end=3D"774">
<h1 data-start=3D"776" data-end=3D"822">=F0=9F=93=88 What happens with diff=
erent epoch values?</h1>
<h2 data-start=3D"824" data-end=3D"837"><code data-start=3D"827" data-end=
=3D"837">epochs=3D1</code></h2>
<ul data-start=3D"838" data-end=3D"917">
<li data-start=3D"838" data-end=3D"851">
<p data-start=3D"840" data-end=3D"851">Very fast</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"852" data-end=3D"875">
<p data-start=3D"854" data-end=3D"875">Model barely learns</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"876" data-end=3D"917">
<p data-start=3D"878" data-end=3D"917">Good only for testing/troubleshootin=
g</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-start=3D"919" data-end=3D"932"><code data-start=3D"922" data-end=
=3D"932">epochs=3D3</code></h2>
<ul data-start=3D"933" data-end=3D"1054">
<li data-start=3D"933" data-end=3D"963">
<p data-start=3D"935" data-end=3D"963">Good <strong data-start=3D"940" data=
-end=3D"961">baseline accuracy</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"964" data-end=3D"972">
<p data-start=3D"966" data-end=3D"972">Fast</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"973" data-end=3D"1013">
<p data-start=3D"975" data-end=3D"1013">Recommended for a first training ru=
n</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1014" data-end=3D"1054">
<p data-start=3D"1016" data-end=3D"1054">Will already beat Open-Meteo somet=
imes</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-start=3D"1056" data-end=3D"1069"><code data-start=3D"1059" data-en=
d=3D"1069">epochs=3D5</code></h2>
<ul data-start=3D"1070" data-end=3D"1150">
<li data-start=3D"1070" data-end=3D"1089">
<p data-start=3D"1072" data-end=3D"1089">Better accuracy</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1090" data-end=3D"1104">
<p data-start=3D"1092" data-end=3D"1104">Still fast</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1105" data-end=3D"1150">
<p data-start=3D"1107" data-end=3D"1150">Recommended for "normal" Zeus mine=
r quality</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-start=3D"1152" data-end=3D"1166"><code data-start=3D"1155" data-en=
d=3D"1166">epochs=3D10</code></h2>
<ul data-start=3D"1167" data-end=3D"1257">
<li data-start=3D"1167" data-end=3D"1194">
<p data-start=3D"1169" data-end=3D"1194">Good high-quality model</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1195" data-end=3D"1225">
<p data-start=3D"1197" data-end=3D"1225">Better temporal smoothness</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1226" data-end=3D"1257">
<p data-start=3D"1228" data-end=3D"1257">Recommended for long-term use</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-start=3D"1259" data-end=3D"1274"><code data-start=3D"1262" data-en=
d=3D"1274">epochs=3D20+</code></h2>
<ul data-start=3D"1275" data-end=3D"1367">
<li data-start=3D"1275" data-end=3D"1285">
<p data-start=3D"1277" data-end=3D"1285">Slower</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1286" data-end=3D"1309">
<p data-start=3D"1288" data-end=3D"1309">May or may not help</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1310" data-end=3D"1367">
<p data-start=3D"1312" data-end=3D"1367">Only necessary for <strong data-st=
art=3D"1331" data-end=3D"1348">precipitation</strong>, which is harder</p>
</li>
</ul>
