<h2 data-start=3D"196" data-end=3D"222"><strong data-start=3D"199" data-end=
=3D"222">NO. Absolutely not.</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"224" data-end=3D"281">=E2=9C=94 You train the model <stro=
ng data-start=3D"250" data-end=3D"262">one time</strong> on a GPU machine</=
h3>
<h3 data-start=3D"282" data-end=3D"347">=E2=9C=94 Then copy the <code data-=
start=3D"302" data-end=3D"307">.pt</code> model files + norm JSON to your m=
iner</h3>
<h3 data-start=3D"348" data-end=3D"403">=E2=9C=94 The miner only does <stro=
ng data-start=3D"374" data-end=3D"387">inference</strong>, not training</h3=
>
<h3 data-start=3D"404" data-end=3D"489">=E2=9C=94 The miner does <strong da=
ta-start=3D"425" data-end=3D"448">not need to retrain</strong> unless <em d=
ata-start=3D"456" data-end=3D"489">you choose to improve the model</em></h3=
>
<hr data-start=3D"491" data-end=3D"494">
<h1 data-start=3D"496" data-end=3D"530">=F0=9F=A7=A0 <strong data-start=3D"=
501" data-end=3D"530">Why training is one-time?</strong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"532" data-end=3D"557">The Zeus subnet does NOT:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"559" data-end=3D"642">
<li data-start=3D"559" data-end=3D"582">
<p data-start=3D"561" data-end=3D"582">require re-training</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"583" data-end=3D"605">
<p data-start=3D"585" data-end=3D"605">reward re-training</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"606" data-end=3D"624">
<p data-start=3D"608" data-end=3D"624">replace models</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"625" data-end=3D"642">
<p data-start=3D"627" data-end=3D"642">update models</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"644" data-end=3D"676">Zeus validators only care about:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"678" data-end=3D"782">
<li data-start=3D"678" data-end=3D"706">
<p data-start=3D"680" data-end=3D"706">your <strong data-start=3D"685" data=
-end=3D"706">forecast accuracy</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"707" data-end=3D"733">
<p data-start=3D"709" data-end=3D"733">your <strong data-start=3D"714" data=
-end=3D"733">inference speed</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"734" data-end=3D"751">
<p data-start=3D"736" data-end=3D"751">your <strong data-start=3D"741" data=
-end=3D"751">uptime</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"752" data-end=3D"782">
<p data-start=3D"754" data-end=3D"782">your <strong data-start=3D"759" data=
-end=3D"782">peer responsiveness</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"784" data-end=3D"831">The model can be trained once and us=
ed forever.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"833" data-end=3D"836">
<h1 data-start=3D"838" data-end=3D"876">=F0=9F=A7=A9 <strong data-start=3D"=
843" data-end=3D"876">Your workflow looks like this</strong></h1>
<h2 data-start=3D"878" data-end=3D"916"><strong data-start=3D"881" data-end=
=3D"914">Step 1 =E2=80=94 Download ERA5 (done)</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"917" data-end=3D"953">You downloaded data from 2020 =E2=86=
=92 now.</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"955" data-end=3D"1006"><strong data-start=3D"958" data-en=
d=3D"1004">Step 2 =E2=80=94 Train 8 models (one per variable)</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"1007" data-end=3D"1024">You do this once:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1026" data-end=3D"1186">
<li data-start=3D"1026" data-end=3D"1044">
<p data-start=3D"1028" data-end=3D"1044"><code data-start=3D"1028" data-end=
=3D"1044">2m_temperature</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1045" data-end=3D"1072">
<p data-start=3D"1047" data-end=3D"1072"><code data-start=3D"1047" data-end=
=3D"1072">2m_dewpoint_temperature</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1073" data-end=3D"1082">
<p data-start=3D"1075" data-end=3D"1082"><code data-start=3D"1075" data-end=
=3D"1082">10m_u</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1083" data-end=3D"1092">
<p data-start=3D"1085" data-end=3D"1092"><code data-start=3D"1085" data-end=
=3D"1092">10m_v</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1093" data-end=3D"1103">
<p data-start=3D"1095" data-end=3D"1103"><code data-start=3D"1095" data-end=
=3D"1103">100m_u</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1104" data-end=3D"1114">
<p data-start=3D"1106" data-end=3D"1114"><code data-start=3D"1106" data-end=
=3D"1114">100m_v</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1115" data-end=3D"1135">
<p data-start=3D"1117" data-end=3D"1135"><code data-start=3D"1117" data-end=
=3D"1135">surface_pressure</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1136" data-end=3D"1186">
<p data-start=3D"1138" data-end=3D"1186"><code data-start=3D"1138" data-end=
=3D"1159">total_precipitation</code> (precip needs more epochs)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1188" data-end=3D"1231">This requires GPU for speed, but o=
nly once.</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"1233" data-end=3D"1284"><strong data-start=3D"1236" data-=
end=3D"1284">Step 3 =E2=80=94 Copy trained models to miner server</strong><=
