sends them a <code data-start=3D"1733" data-end=3D"1756">TimePredictionSyna=
pse</code> with:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1768" data-end=3D"1848">
<li data-start=3D"1768" data-end=3D"1802">
<p data-start=3D"1770" data-end=3D"1802">the input grid (lat, lon, times)</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1808" data-end=3D"1822">
<p data-start=3D"1810" data-end=3D"1822">the variable</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1828" data-end=3D"1848">
<p data-start=3D"1830" data-end=3D"1848">the forecast range</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1850" data-end=3D"2025">
