nd=3D"1894">Receives predictions + response times</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1899" data-end=3D"2025">
<li data-start=3D"1899" data-end=3D"1959">
<p data-start=3D"1901" data-end=3D"1959"><code data-start=3D"1901" data-end=
=3D"1912">responses</code> contain tensors and <code data-start=3D"1933" da=
ta-end=3D"1956">dendrite.process_time</code>.</p>
