tor=E2=80=99s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9728" data-end=3D"9753">
<p data-start=3D"9730" data-end=3D"9753">basic latency logging</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9754" data-end=3D"9961">
<p data-start=3D"9756" data-end=3D"9824">Or I can help you design a small <=
strong data-start=3D"9789" data-end=3D"9818">offline evaluation script</str=
ong> that:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"9827" data-end=3D"9961">
<li data-start=3D"9827" data-end=3D"9847">
<p data-start=3D"9829" data-end=3D"9847">loads ERA5 tiles</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9850" data-end=3D"9877">
<p data-start=3D"9852" data-end=3D"9877">runs your trained model</p>
