<h3 data-start=3D"3996" data-end=3D"4031">=E2=9C=94 No shape mismatch penal=
ties</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4032" data-end=3D"4113">Validator checks shape early; our =
sanitizer mirrors <code data-start=3D"4084" data-end=3D"4112">help_format_m=
iner_output()</code>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4115" data-end=3D"4165">=E2=9C=94 Safe against ConvTransp=
ose2d spatial drift</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4167" data-end=3D"4193">Even if your UNet outputs:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4195" data-end=3D"4246">
