<p data-start=3D"4248" data-end=3D"4298">=E2=86=92 sanitizer clamps/pads co=
rrectly using ERA5 grid.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4300" data-end=3D"4352">=E2=9C=94 Protects you from rando=
m zero-score failures</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4354" data-end=3D"4384">Most miners lose score due to:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4386" data-end=3D"4508">
<li data-start=3D"4386" data-end=3D"4394">
<p data-start=3D"4388" data-end=3D"4394">NaNs</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4395" data-end=3D"4410">
<p data-start=3D"4397" data-end=3D"4410">wrong shape</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4411" data-end=3D"4436">
<p data-start=3D"4413" data-end=3D"4436">incorrect list format</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4437" data-end=3D"4453">
<p data-start=3D"4439" data-end=3D"4453">swapped dims</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4454" data-end=3D"4481">
<p data-start=3D"4456" data-end=3D"4481">forecast too short/long</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4482" data-end=3D"4508">
<p data-start=3D"4484" data-end=3D"4508">last dimension extra 1</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4510" data-end=3D"4561">Your miner will no longer have any=
 of these issues.</p>
